Overcharge your psionic focus with energy for [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] turns, producing a different effect depending on what it is.

A telekinetically wielded melee weapon enters a frenzy, striking up to [1, 2, 3, 3, 3 (TL1-5)] enemies per turn, also increases the radius by [1, 2, 3, 3, 3 (TL1-5)].

A mindstar will attempt to pull in all enemies within its normal range.

A gem will fire an energy bolt at a random enemy in range 6, each turn for [120, 162, 195, 222, 247 (TL1-5; MP 100)] damage. The type is determined by the colour of the gem. Damage scales with Mindpower.
